WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.000
-Guys, big news today.
Our friends over at Ford

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.267
announced that they're
partnering

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:05.667
with Oracle Red Bull Racing

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.567
to return to the Formula 1
racing circuit.

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:09.534
This is giant.

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:10.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:11.734
This is massive.

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:13.567
And just -- just thinking
about it

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:15.467
got my competitive juices
flowing.

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.801
So, with the help of Ford,
I decided to challenge

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:20.167
one of the world's
top Formula 1 drivers

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:22.934
to a race on a go-kart track.

00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:24.701
Check it out.

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:27.601
-Hey guys, I'm here
at RPM Raceway in New Jersey,

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:31.067
and I'm joined by the boss
at Ford, Jim Farley.

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:32.901
Now Jim, tonight,
I'm going to be racing

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:35.701
one of the top Formula 1 drivers
in the world,

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.467
Sergio "Checo" Pérez.

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:38.968
-Huge.
-I'm a little nervous.

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:41.267
But before we get into that,
I want to talk about Ford

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:43.234
coming back
into Formula 1 racing.

00:00:43.234 --> 00:00:45.400
-We haven't been in Formula 1
in 20 years, but --

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.501
and we're going back.

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:47.868
And racing's gotten huge.

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:49.734
Formula 1's gotten huge
in the US,

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:52.133
and we want to use it to promote
our electric vehicles,

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:54.000
so it's -- it makes sense
for us.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.000
-And you've got
a good team, too.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.667
-Well, we're going to join
Red Bull.

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:59.167
Like, they've been world
champion for a couple times.

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:00.367
-You got Red Bull.
You got a good team.

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.467
-Oh, yeah.
It's perfect for us.

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:03.734
-Of course, you would do this.

00:01:03.734 --> 00:01:06.667
-You know, 'cause some CEOs
are into golf or tennis.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:07.868
-Yeah, yeah.
-Or yachting.

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:10.300
But I like racing.
[ Laughs ]

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.934
-Now Jim, you were a racer
yourself.

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:14.033
Last year, I got to visit you
in Detroit.

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:16.200
You took me out for a spin.
It was so much fun.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.601
I loved every single minute
of it.

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:19.701
I was kind of a natural,

00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:20.901
is what I heard a lot of people
saying...

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:22.601
-Yeah, you were. Totally.
-...as I was driving by.

00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:23.734
I handled it very well.
-Yeah.

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.567
-Racing is in my blood.
-Yeah.

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:28.100
-But tonight's serious.
There's a lot at stake here.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.667
Pride is on the line.
-Yes.

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.167
-So, you have agreed
to help train

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:32.367
to get me ready for the race.

00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:35.634
-I think you are, like,
the ideal candidate

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:38.300
to beat the best
Formula 1 drivers in the world.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.567
You're perfect.
-Thank you.

00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:41.133
Are we -- Did we get that
on tape? Did we record it?

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.000
Because that is -- Finally
someone's saying that.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.234
-Yeah.

00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:49.734
♪♪

00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:50.901
[ Engine roars ]

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:52.000
-First thing we have to do

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.033
is visualize yourself
behind the wheel.

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:55.467
-Okay.
-So, close your eyes.

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:57.567
-Yep.
-And then steer the wheel.

00:01:57.567 --> 00:01:58.567
That's it, yep.

00:01:58.567 --> 00:01:59.934
So, you're racing right now.

00:01:59.934 --> 00:02:01.501
And then you're pressing
the throttle.

00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:03.434
Press the throttle,
press the throttle.

00:02:03.434 --> 00:02:05.200
And then don't forget
honking the horn.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:06.267
Got to honk the horn.
Yeah.

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:07.968
-This is going to help me
win the race?

00:02:07.968 --> 00:02:09.834
-No, actually,
it's for my TikTok.

00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:11.734
♪♪

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:13.067
[ Engine roars ]

00:02:13.067 --> 00:02:14.534
-Okay, Jim, it's time to drive.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:15.968
These things are electric.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:19.467
They've been hooked up to an
F-150 Lightning all day long.

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:21.234
-So, that's means
they're going to go really fast.

00:02:21.234 --> 00:02:22.400
So, let's go take a lap.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.000
-Let's do it.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.434
♪♪

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:30.868
Wait for me!

00:02:33.634 --> 00:02:35.267
Dude, this thing is awesome.

00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:37.067
My gosh.

00:02:37.067 --> 00:02:38.968
Whoo!

00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:42.601
-Good job, Jimmy.

00:02:42.601 --> 00:02:45.701
-This is like
real-life Mario Kart.

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:46.934
Oh, my gosh.

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:49.801
♪♪

00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:51.400
[ Tires screech ]

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.133
-All right, Jimmy,
I think you're ready.

00:02:53.133 --> 00:02:54.901
It's time to suit up.

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:56.601
♪♪

00:02:56.601 --> 00:02:58.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:06.200
♪♪

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.367
All right, Checo.

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:09.067
-Jim, how are you doing?
-Ah, good to see you.

00:03:09.067 --> 00:03:10.367
Pretty -- Pretty exciting

00:03:10.367 --> 00:03:13.300
to have one of the best
Formula 1 pilots

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.701
in the history of the sport
here in the United States.

00:03:15.701 --> 00:03:18.467
♪♪

00:03:18.467 --> 00:03:20.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.734 --> 00:03:23.634
♪♪

00:03:23.634 --> 00:03:25.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:27.701 --> 00:03:30.267
-What's up, dudes?
What's up, Checo?

00:03:30.267 --> 00:03:31.667
-Nice suit.

00:03:31.667 --> 00:03:33.801
-Yeah, I was trying
to do something

00:03:33.801 --> 00:03:35.834
a little more aerodynamic.

00:03:35.834 --> 00:03:37.267
-Oh.

00:03:37.267 --> 00:03:38.968
-I'm going to go get changed.

00:03:40.434 --> 00:03:42.000
[ Engine roars ]

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.868
-Okay, gentlemen,
here to officiate the race

00:03:44.868 --> 00:03:46.834
is Christian Horner,

00:03:46.834 --> 00:03:51.067
the boss of the back-to-back
world champions

00:03:51.067 --> 00:03:52.834
Oracle Red Bull Racing Team.

00:03:52.834 --> 00:03:54.701
-Oh, thank you.
And look, guys,

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:56.267
we want to have
a good clean race.

00:03:56.267 --> 00:03:57.434
Keep it nice and clean
out there.

00:03:57.434 --> 00:04:00.634
No bumping, and no banging.

00:04:00.634 --> 00:04:02.300
But go out there, have some fun.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.968
And good luck.
And may the best man win.

00:04:04.968 --> 00:04:06.100
-Let's go and race.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.801
-I heard you took a DNA test.

00:04:07.801 --> 00:04:10.033
Turns out
you're 100% that bitch.

00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:13.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:13.067 --> 00:04:14.200
Let's go!

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.300
♪♪

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:18.467
[ Engines whir ]

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:20.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:20.968 --> 00:04:25.100
♪♪

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:26.968
You don't want to
mess with me, dude!

00:04:26.968 --> 00:04:32.200
♪♪

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.033
Oh, my God,
I got air on that one.

00:04:34.033 --> 00:04:41.033
♪♪

00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:48.067
♪♪

00:04:48.067 --> 00:04:49.367
Slow down, Chec.

00:04:49.367 --> 00:04:52.634
♪♪

00:04:52.634 --> 00:04:53.801
I'm in the lead.
I'm in the lead!

00:04:53.801 --> 00:04:55.067
I'm in the lead!

00:04:55.067 --> 00:04:57.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.667
Yes, yes!

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:03.067
[ Slow-mo ] Yeeeees!

00:05:03.067 --> 00:05:04.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:04.767 --> 00:05:06.167
[ Normal voice ] Yes!

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:11.434
Whoo! Whoo!

00:05:11.434 --> 00:05:13.000
Jim, we did it!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.434
Whoo!

00:05:14.434 --> 00:05:15.701
Dude!

00:05:15.701 --> 00:05:17.300
We did it!
We did it.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:18.601
[ Laughs ]

00:05:18.601 --> 00:05:19.901
Yes, yes!

00:05:19.901 --> 00:05:21.501
-Good job.
That's for you.

00:05:21.501 --> 00:05:24.067
-The winner.
-Champion!

00:05:24.067 --> 00:05:25.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:30.367 --> 00:05:33.634
-My thanks to Jim Farley,
Christian Horner,

00:05:33.634 --> 00:05:35.067
Sergio "Checo" Pérez,

00:05:35.067 --> 00:05:35.968
and all of our friends
over at Ford and Red Bull.

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:37.367
Stick around.

00:05:37.367 --> 00:05:40.467
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight show," everybody.

00:05:40.467 --> 00:05:41.467
Come on.

